---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /continents.html
title: The Continent Project
description: The Continent Project — a journey to have a painting by Chandrakant R Raut on every continent on earth
pageFonts:
    - Gotu
    - Cinzel:wght@500
tagline:
    mr: जगाच्या कानाकोपऱ्यात
    en: To every corner of the world
---
{%- set cp = continentProject %}
        <section class="continents-section">
            <header class="continents-intro">
                <p class="continents-tagline">
                    <span class="tagline-mr" lang="mr">{{ tagline.mr }}</span>
                    <span class="tagline-en">{{ tagline.en }}</span>
                </p>
                <h1 class="continents-title">The Continent Project</h1>
                <p class="continents-subline">One painting on every continent</p>
                <p class="lead">
                    For most of his life, Mr. Raut's paintings have lived quietly with his family and close friends.
                    A few have gone out into the world without his name, to homes we will never find. He has always
                    painted out of sheer love for the art, never expecting recognition. But we, his family, believe
                    he deserves it, and so does his work.
                </p>
                <p class="lead">
                    The Continent Project is our way of giving his work that recognition: by letting it travel
                    farther, to a home on each of the seven continents.
                </p>

                <ol class="continent-progress" aria-label="{{ cp.stats.reached }} of {{ cp.stats.total }} continents reached">
                    {%- for c in cp.continents %}
                    <li class="{{ 'is-reached' if c.reached else 'is-pending' }}">
                        <a href="#{{ c.slug }}">{{ c.name }}</a>
                    </li>
                    {%- endfor %}
                </ol>
                <p class="continent-progress-count"><strong>{{ cp.stats.reached }}</strong> of {{ cp.stats.total }} continents</p>
            </header>

            <figure class="world-map">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 {{ cp.map.width }} {{ cp.map.height }}" role="img"
                     aria-label="World map showing paintings in {{ cp.stats.homes }} cities across {{ cp.stats.reached }} continents">
                    <path class="map-sphere" d="{{ cp.map.sphere }}"/>
                    <path class="map-land" d="{{ cp.map.land }}"/>
                    <path class="map-highlight" d="{{ cp.map.highlighted }}"/>
                    {%- for c in cp.continents %}
                    {%- if c.marker %}
                    <g class="map-pending" transform="translate({{ c.marker.x }} {{ c.marker.y }})">
                        <circle r="9"/>
                        <text y="-16">{{ c.name }}</text>
                    </g>
                    {%- endif %}
                    {%- for loc in c.locations %}
                    <a href="#{{ c.slug }}" class="map-pin">
                        <circle cx="{{ loc.x }}" cy="{{ loc.y }}" r="6">
                            <title>{{ loc.city }}, {{ loc.country }}</title>
                        </circle>
                    </a>
                    {%- endfor %}
                    {%- endfor %}
                </svg>
                <figcaption>
                    <span class="legend legend-reached">Painting in place</span>
                    <span class="legend legend-pending">Awaiting a painting</span>
                </figcaption>
            </figure>

            <dl class="continent-stats" aria-describedby="continent-stats-note">
                <div><dt>Continents</dt><dd>{{ cp.stats.reached }} / {{ cp.stats.total }}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Cities</dt><dd>{{ cp.stats.homes }}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Countries</dt><dd>{{ cp.stats.countries }}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Farthest from home</dt><dd>{{ cp.stats.farthest.km | toLocaleString }} km</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="continent-stats-note" id="continent-stats-note">Distances are measured from the artist's home in {{ cp.origin.city }}.</p>

            {%- for c in cp.continents %}
            <section class="continent-group{{ '' if c.reached else ' is-pending' }}" id="{{ c.slug }}">
                <h2>{{ c.name }}</h2>
                {%- if c.reached %}
                <div class="location-grid">
                    {%- for loc in c.locations %}
                    <article class="location-card">
                        <div class="location-photo{{ ' is-artwork' if loc.painting and not loc.photo }}">
                            {%- if loc.photo or loc.painting %}
                            {%- set photoFile = loc.photo or loc.painting %}
                            {%- set photoAlt = "Painting by Chandrakant R Raut in " + loc.city %}
                            {%- set photoAttrs = { style: "object-position: " + loc.photoPosition } if loc.photoPosition else {} %}
                            {% image photoFile, photoAlt, "(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 360px", photoAttrs %}
                            {%- else %}
                            <span class="location-photo-placeholder">Photo coming soon</span>
                            {%- endif %}
                        </div>
                        <div class="location-info">
                            <h3>{{ loc.city }}</h3>
                            <p class="location-place">{{ loc.region }}, {{ loc.country }}</p>
                            <p class="location-coords">{{ loc.coords }}</p>
                            <p class="location-distance">
                                {{ loc.km | toLocaleString }} km from {{ cp.origin.city }}
                                {%- if loc.year %} · {{ loc.year }}{% endif %}
                            </p>
                            {%- if loc.story %}
                            <p class="location-story">{{ loc.story }}</p>
                            {%- endif %}
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    {%- endfor %}
                </div>
                {%- else %}
                <p class="continent-pending-text">
                    Awaiting its first painting. Do you know a home in {{ c.name }} that would welcome one?
                    <a href="/contact.html">Leave us a message</a>.
                </p>
                {%- endif %}
            </section>
            {%- endfor %}

            <aside class="continents-note" aria-labelledby="continents-note-title">
                <h2 id="continents-note-title">Why this project</h2>
                <p>
                    I have watched Daddyji paint with the same joy for years, and it always struck me how few
                    people outside our family had seen his work. This project is my small tribute to him: a way
                    for his paintings to travel as far as they deserve, one continent at a time.
                </p>
                <p class="continents-note-signature">— Sameer</p>
            </aside>
        </section>
